  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "語音識別與自然語言處理",
    "sub_ename": "SPEECH AND LANGUAGE PROCESSING",
    "describe_ch": "語音與語言技術發展的基石是建立於計算機科學，語言學，數學，電機工程，甚至是心理學等領域知識。因此，為了發展基於複雜運算的人機通信技術，本課程涵蓋下列主題: -學習模型以及演算: 狀態機、概率模型、向量空間模型等等 -狀態空間搜尋演算法，像是動態規劃演算 (語音辨識系統的維特比解碼) -機器學習模型: 單純貝式分類模型，羅吉斯回歸分類等等 其他像是最大概似估算原則，隨機梯度下降法的估計值優化，以及應用於自然語言處理任務的類神經網絡。",
    "describe_eh": "The foundations of speech and language technology lie in computer science, linguistic, mathematics, electrical engineering and psychology, etc. Thus to develop the art of enabling human-machine communication in terms of sophisticated algorithms, this course covers the following issues: -Models, and algorithms: state machine, probabilistic models, vector-space models, etc. -State space searching algorithms, like dynamic programming (Viterbi-decoding) -Machine learning algorithms, like Na?ve Bayes’ model, parametrized linear model, etc. -Others, like the maximum likelihood principle, the SGD optimization, neural language model, etc.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
